data_2h_tas2
# Phase identity: room-temperature parent 2H-TaS2, P63/mmc, Z=2.
# Provenance: Meetsma et al., Acta Cryst. C46, 1598--1599 (1990),
# doi:10.1107/S0108270190000014; COD 9007815 (CC0):
# https://www.crystallography.net/cod/9007815.cif
# The source 2b/4f sites are expanded explicitly in P1. The low-temperature
# CDW superstructure is intentionally excluded. Odd 00l cancel between layers,
# so (002) is the first allowed reflection parallel to basal cleavage (001).
# The catalog B_ang2=0.6 A^2 is a modeling placeholder, not source-derived.
# Limiting checks: V=sqrt(3)a^2c/2, Ta2S4, F001=0 and finite F002.
# Validation: 2h-tas2-p63mmc-structure
